      expl="**答案依据**：二元函数的全微分（多元函数微分学）。\n**考点出处**：二元函数的全微分（多元函数微分学）\n**第一步：写出全微分公式。**\n\n$$\\mathrm{d}z = \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\mathrm{d}x + \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}\\mathrm{d}y$$\n\n**第二步：分别求两个偏导数。**\n\n$$\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x} = 6x^2, \\qquad \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y} = -6y$$\n\n**第三步：代入 $(1,1)$。**\n\n$$\\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(1,1)} = 6\\times 1^2 = 6, \\qquad \\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y}\\right|_{(1,1)} = -6\\times 1 = -6$$\n\n**第四步：组装成全微分。**\n\n$$\\left.\\mathrm{d}z\\right|_{(1,1)} = 6\\,\\mathrm{d}x - 6\\,\\mathrm{d}y$$\n\n选 **C**。",
